e member may ask.\n- Accepted Pulse introductions are now recorded in Network (PulseNetworkBridgeService bound to PULSE_INTRODUCTION_PORT),\n  so a recruiter's Network fills with the bench-sales recruiters and consultants they have worked with.\n- Jobs and Add Consultant roles are unchanged: recruiters post jobs, bench-sales recruiters add consultants.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T13:31:21-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/cd0ee398ec8e5e1f3a0b0a4f7384742645a74795","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T13:31:21-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T13:31:21-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261129100000_employer_settings/migration.sql","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.builders.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.controller.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.module.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.service.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.spec.ts","src/network/pulse-network-bridge.service.spec.ts","src/network/pulse-network-bridge.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["docs/migrations/20261128-consultant-and-bench-dashboard.md","prisma/schema.prisma","src/bench/bench.module.ts","src/bench/employer-overview.service.spec.ts","src/bench/employer-overview.service.ts","src/hiring/hiring-overview.builders.ts","src/hiring/hiring-overview.service.ts","src/hiring/hiring-overview.spec.ts","src/hiring/hiring.module.ts","src/network/network.module.ts","src/pulse/pulse.module.ts"]}],"head_commit":{"id":"cd0ee398ec8e5e1f3a0b0a4f7384742645a74795","tree_id":"29c6970c62b699f78bd4c13688340269d8192bde","distinct":true,"message":"Employer settings and access, Pulse-to-Network bridge\n\n- employer_settings table (migration 20261129100000) and GET/PATCH /employers/:orgId/settings: whether the company runs\n  a bench, hires, or both (never neither), the company domain used to verify people, and the alert thresholds. The\n  thresholds drive the hiring overview and the employer's bench numbers.\n- GET /employers/:orgId/access: what the member's role may see (company-wide overview, team, bench, hiring, reports,\n  credits, settings) plus the company's mode. Any active member may ask.\n- Accepted Pulse introductions are now recorded in Network (PulseNetworkBridgeService bound to PULSE_INTRODUCTION_PORT),\n  so a recruiter's Network fills with the bench-sales recruiters and consultants they have worked with.\n- Jobs and Add Consultant roles are unchanged: recruiters post jobs, bench-sales recruiters add consultants.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T13:31:21-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/cd0ee398ec8e5e1f3a0b0a4f7384742645a74795","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T13:31:21-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T13:31:21-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261129100000_employer_settings/migration.sql","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.builders.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.controller.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.module.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.service.ts","src/employer-settings/employer-settings.spec.ts","src/network/pulse-network-bridge.service.spec.ts","src/network/pulse-network-bridge.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["docs/migrations/20261128-consultant-and-bench-dashboard.md","prisma/schema.prisma","src/bench/bench.module.ts","src/bench/employer-overview.service.spec.ts","src/bench/employer-overview.service.ts","src/hiring/hiring-overview.builders.ts","src/hiring/hiring-overv